{
  "helpId": "sys.time-settings.edit",
  "lang": "en",
  "title": "Time settings",
  "entity": "HCMv3.SystemSettings.ManageTimeSettings",
  "overviewHtml": "<p>Company-wide time and attendance behaviour: where evaluation starts, rosters, the attendance integrations, how holidays combine with off days, hourly leave, overtime, forfeiting leave and approval of time registers.</p><p>Many of the leave-request rules in the lower half are not enforced at present and say so.</p><p>There is one settings record per company; it cannot be deleted.</p>",
